# Check out every text file with LF endings on every platform. Without this,
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks the tracked config out as CRLF while
# the gitignored config.yaml copy is LF, and the byte-for-byte comparison in
# tests/test_deployment_config.py::TestConfigCopiesInSync fails locally.
# Shell scripts and the config packaged into the Lambda also need LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
